      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aElectromagnetic Separator / Electromagnetic Polarizer§r\n\nDon't give up your imagination.\nControlling the magnetic domains inside the crystal, yes that's it.\n64x Parallel per Ring.(Don't use a lot of blueprints when first scanning.)\nAdditional 25% reduction in time per Voltage Tier, multiplication calculus.\nUse screwdriver to change mode.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Output Hatch, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Naquadah Alloy Frame Boxes; Tengam Attuned Frame Boxes; Compact Fusion Coils; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembler, UHV\n - 64x Industrial Magnetar Separator\n - 16x Electromagnetic Separator UHV\n - 16x Polarizer UHV\n - 3x Field Generator UV\n - 8x Robot Arm UHV\n - 16x UEV Circuit\n - 64x Black Plutonium Plate\n - 16x Superconductor UHV 4x Wire\n - 9,216 L Solder plasma",
